From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: taynotfound <marztayron@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 17:30:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] rain-0979: touch stage C10, NT36525B firmware download

C9 proved SPI RX (loopback + trim ID 0b..25 65 03). Rings now wrap and
events are read and cleared through the uncached alias; TX up to 4 KiB.
Download novatek_ts_fw.bin (from /chosen/memory-map TouchFW, put there by
mkpayload --blob) with the hw-crc flow of Xiaomi's nt36xxx_fw_update.c,
read the firmware info and poll the point buffer for 30 s.
---
